{"chapters":[{"title":"Every pair","code":"def max_area(height):\n    n = len(height)\n    return max((j - i) * min(height[i], height[j]) for i in range(n) for j in range(i + 1, n))","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Every pair</strong> &mdash; O(n&sup2;) time, O(1) extra space. Input: <code>max_area(height=[1, 1])</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":1,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"height","label":"height","v":["1","1"],"cls":["",""]}],"vars":[],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>n = len(height)</code> &mdash; <code>n = 2</code>","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"height","label":"height","v":["1","1"],"cls":["",""]}],"vars":[["n","2",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return max((j - i) * min(height[i], height[j]) for i in range(n) for j in range(i + 1, n))</code> &mdash; calls <code>&lt;genexpr&gt;()</code>","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"height","label":"height","v":["1","1"],"cls":["",""]}],"vars":[["n","2",0]],"stack":["max_area(height)","<genexpr>()"]},{"caption":"<code>return max((j - i) * min(height[i], height[j]) for i in range(n) for j in range(i + 1, n))</code> &mdash; yields <code>1</code>; <code>i = 0</code>; <code>j = 1</code>","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"height","label":"height","v":["1","1"],"cls":["src","src"],"ptr":{"0":["i"],"1":["j"]}}],"vars":[["n","2",0],["i","0",1],["j","1",1]],"stack":["max_area(height)","<genexpr>()"]},{"caption":"<code>return max((j - i) * min(height[i], height[j]) for i in range(n) for j in range(i + 1, n))</code>","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"height","label":"height","v":["1","1"],"cls":["src","src"],"ptr":{"0":["i"],"1":["j"]}}],"vars":[["n","2",0],["i","0",0],["j","1",0]],"stack":["max_area(height)","<genexpr>()"]},{"caption":"<code>return max((j - i) * min(height[i], height[j]) for i in range(n) for j in range(i + 1, n))</code> &mdash; <code>i = 1</code>","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"height","label":"height","v":["1","1"],"cls":["","src"],"ptr":{"1":["i","j"]}}],"vars":[["n","2",0],["i","1",1],["j","1",0]],"stack":["max_area(height)","<genexpr>()"]},{"caption":"<code>return max((j - i) * min(height[i], height[j]) for i in range(n) for j in range(i + 1, n))</code> &mdash; yields <code>None</code>. <strong>Result: 1</strong>","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"height","label":"height","v":["1","1"],"cls":["","src"],"ptr":{"1":["i","j"]}}],"vars":[["n","2",0],["i","1",0],["j","1",0]],"stack":["max_area(height)","<genexpr>()"]}]},{"title":"Two pointers, move the shorter side","code":"def max_area(height):\n    lo, hi, best = 0, len(height) - 1, 0\n    while lo < hi:\n        best = max(best, (hi - lo) * min(height[lo], height[hi]))\n        if height[lo] < height[hi]:\n            lo += 1                            # the shorter line cannot do better\n        else:\n            hi -= 1\n    return best","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Two pointers, move the shorter side</strong> &mdash; O(n) time, O(1) extra space. Input: <code>max_area(height=[1, 8, 6, 2, 5, 4, 8, 3, …])</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":1,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"height","label":"height","v":["1","8","6","2","5","4","8","3","7"],"cls":["","","","","","","","",""]}],"vars":[],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>lo, hi, best = 0, len(height) - 1, 0</code> &mdash; <code>lo = 0</code>; <code>hi = 8</code>; <code>best = 0</code>","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"height","label":"height","v":["1","8","6","2","5","4","8","3","7"],"cls":["src","","","","","","","","src"],"ptr":{"8":["hi"],"0":["lo"]}}],"vars":[["lo","0",1],["hi","8",1],["best","0",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>while lo &lt; hi:</code> &rarr; <strong>true</strong> (hi = 8, lo = 0)","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"height","label":"height","v":["1","8","6","2","5","4","8","3","7"],"cls":["src","","","","","","","","src"],"ptr":{"8":["hi"],"0":["lo"]}}],"vars":[["lo","0",0],["hi","8",0],["best","0",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>best = max(best, (hi - lo) * min(height[lo], 